luids. Addressing these nutritional challenges is crucial to prevent further health complications, such as malnutrition and dehydration. The interconnectedness of dysphagia and nutritional care highlights the need for comprehensive strategies that involve both clinical staff and innovative assessment tools [Data: Relationships (2230)].\n\n## Gabriela C.'s contribution to dysphagia care\n\nGabriela C. has made significant contributions to dysphagia management by designing a mobile health app specifically for patients recovering from head and neck cancer. This app aims to provide resources and support for individuals facing the challenges of dysphagia, showcasing the potential of digital health solutions in enhancing patient care and engagement. The relationship between Gabriela C. and dysphagia underscores the importance of innovation in addressing healthcare challenges [Data: Entities (1331); Relationships (2221)].\n\n## Photovoice methodology for raising awareness\n\nPhotovoice is a qualitative research methodology that can be utilized to give a voice to dysphagia patients, helping to raise awareness about their condition and needs. By engaging patients in documenting their experiences through photography, this approach can highlight the challenges they face and inform healthcare providers and policymakers about necessary improvements in care and support. The relationship between dysphagia and Photovoice emphasizes the importance of patient-centered approaches in healthcare [Data: Entities (1317); Relationships (2219)].", "# Manual de Nutrición Artificial Community\n\nThe community is centered around the 'Manual de Nutrición Artificial', a clinical guide aimed at enhancing nutritional practices in healthcare. Key entities include specialists in various medical fields who support the implementation of this manual, indicating a collaborative effort to improve patient care through better nutritional practices.\n\n## Centrality of the Manual de Nutrición Artificial\n\n